rew of the most dangerous and desperate beings in the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TAKE ON CONTRACTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111920/extras/aecb6d74287cefda40ee51eacd06fd8c.poster.avif?t=1745556118\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111920/extras/aecb6d74287cefda40ee51eacd06fd8c.webm?t=1745556118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111920/extras/aecb6d74287cefda40ee51eacd06fd8c.mp4?t=1745556118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Complete dangerous and illicit procedurally generated contracts.\u00a0</strong>It\u2019s all part of daily life as a Space Slug: transport illegal cargo, scavenge battlefields, steal rare artifacts, and kidnap valuable creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MAINTAIN YOUR SHIP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111920/extras/153970f2bf441064995a9e31787114eb.poster.avif?t=1745556118\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111920/extras/153970f2bf441064995a9e31787114eb.webm?t=1745556118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111920/extras/153970f2bf441064995a9e31787114eb.mp4?t=1745556118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The coffins that Space Slugs call ships are unreliable at best.\u00a0 You\u2019ll need to keep them patched\u00a0up!</strong> Restart broken systems, repair walls and engines, and decide which sections of the ship to keep pressurized in order to protect your cargo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SURVIVE THE HORROR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111920/extras/a954a5933fd266d04c1685c049d59d90.poster.avif?t=1745556118\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111920/extras/a954a5933fd266d04c1685c049d59d90.webm?t=1745556118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111920/extras/a954a5933fd266d04c1685c049d59d90.mp4?t=1745556118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Investigate derelict craft and passing planetoids for trash and treasures.\u00a0</strong> Beware the dangers lurking within. Spacewalk your way to riches or ruin, and get used to dragging your friend\u2019s corpses back to the respawn platform.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DELIVER THE CARGO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111920/extras/07e3d8890af2a0d2f70dc39e0a0d53f2.poster.avif?t=1745556118\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111920/extras/07e3d8890af2a0d2f70dc39e0a0d53f2.webm?t=1745556118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111920/extras/07e3d8890af2a0d2f70dc39e0a0d53f2.mp4?t=1745556118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unload cargo onto the cargo platform while still warding off possible dangers.\u00a0</strong>Repair your ship as much as possible to minimize your ship damage penalty. Once the mission is over, look for new contracts to expand your smuggling legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KILL YOUR FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111920/extras/8a9a755524c2b9c9853d8f0ab82813fd.poster.avif?t=1745556118\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111920/extras/8a9a755524c2b9c9853d8f0ab82813fd.webm?t=1745556118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111920/extras/8a9a755524c2b9c9853d8f0ab82813fd.mp4?t=1745556118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle your way in<strong> fully customizable deathmatch! </strong>Cunningly use the environment to your advantage or wade in with energy blades to prove you\u2019re the ultimate swordsman!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Explore procedurally generated missions solo or with your crew of up to 3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Only one key needed \u2013 Airlock Arena\u2019s multiplayer is experienced entirely through RemotePlay, recreating classic couch coop action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Earn credits to secure your Space Slug\u2019s name in the High Scores of Immortality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Full coop and competitive modes. Work as a team for your shared success or throw down the gauntlet in Airlock Arena\u2019s deathmatch!</p>",
